<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 300 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 300 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.581   PAY DATE  S-26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.631    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT,LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG	 MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC   1.95</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT SEP 2003 BUND  NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
